{"4440980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Warstate", "steam_appid": 4440980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A sandbox warzone where chaos is the gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a living battlefield where systems collide and every match creates its own story. Civilians roam, enemies clash, and the environment reacts—turning every fight into a dynamic, unpredictable chain of events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t scripted chaos. It’s simulated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across 24+ maps built for emergent gameplay, where your choices—and everything around you—can spiral the match in unexpected directions. Play it tactical, go in aggressive, or embrace the madness and see what unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump between intense multiplayer combat and survival modes. Hold out in Zombies, or navigate constant tension in Undead mode where threats can emerge at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through pure gameplay. Complete missions, reach high scores, and unlock weapon camos, character skins, and upgrades. No pay-to-win—every advantage is earned inside the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the battlefield isn’t unpredictable enough, take a risk at the in-match casino for weapons that can instantly shift the balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two matches are the same. No outcome is guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt. Survive. Or get consumed by the chaos.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A sandbox warzone where chaos is the gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a living battlefield where systems collide and every match creates its own story. Civilians roam, enemies clash, and the environment reacts—turning every fight into a dynamic, unpredictable chain of events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t scripted chaos. It’s simulated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight across 24+ maps built for emergent gameplay, where your choices—and everything around you—can spiral the match in unexpected directions. Play it tactical, go in aggressive, or embrace the madness and see what unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump between intense multiplayer combat and survival modes. Hold out in Zombies, or navigate constant tension in Undead mode where threats can emerge at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through pure gameplay. Complete missions, reach high scores, and unlock weapon camos, character skins, and upgrades. No pay-to-win—every advantage is earned inside the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the battlefield isn’t unpredictable enough, take a risk at the in-match casino for weapons that can instantly shift the balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two matches are the same. No outcome is guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt. Survive. Or get consumed by the chaos.</p>", "short_description": "Drop into a relentless, fast-paced battlefield where every match is unpredictable and nothing is off-limits. Fight across 24+ diverse maps packed with dynamic elements, roaming civilians, and sandbox-driven chaos that lets you play however you want", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440980/eae7d2a56a2f026af3a962f7a286292eebaeb2ea/header.jpg?t=1776788822", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440980/2a1214b6821a6d2d9dc170087d4ce4f9e83647ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776788822", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4440980/2a1214b6821a6d2d9dc170087d4ce4f9e83647ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776788822", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Wind